   - Add a new webhook with the payload URL pointing to your Jenkins server (e.g., `http://jenkins-server/github-webhook/`).
   - Set the content type to `application/json`.
   - Ensure the webhook is triggered on push events.

#### Step 2: Configure Jenkins Job

