2. **Automatic Build**: Jenkins will automatically trigger the job to run the tests.

### Conclusion

By automating the process to run tests every time code changes are pushed to the repository, you can ensure that your application remains stable and reliable. This approach leverages Jenkins to handle the build and test process, making it seamless and efficient.

