        }
        success {
            echo 'All tests passed!'
        }
        failure {
            echo 'Some tests failed.'
        }
    }
}
```

### Summary

By leveraging parallel testing with `pytest-xdist`, optimizing individual test cases, profiling and identifying bottlenecks, using caching, and optimizing your Jenkinsfile, you can further reduce the test runtime and achieve even faster execution times. These strategies should help you streamline your CI process and improve overall efficiency.

