- **Snyk Documentation**: [Snyk Official Documentation](https://docs.snyk.io/)
- **Jenkins Plugin Documentation**: [Snyk Jenkins Plugin Documentation](https://plugins.jenkins.io/snyk/)
- **Jenkins Pipeline Syntax**: [Jenkins Pipeline Syntax Reference](https://www.jenkins.io/doc/book/pipeline/syntax/)

